    "pageTexts": [
      "Rainy Day Reading Plan\nA Weekend Guide for Cozy Reading\nReading Nook Preparation\nChoose a quiet, comfortable corner with good lighting.\nAdd a cozy chair or a few cushions for comfort.\nPlace a small table to hold your books and a warm drink.\nEnsure you have a warm blanket on hand.\nGather candles or a reading lamp for softer light.\nUse this checklist for selecting your ideal books:\nSelect books you’ve been excited to read.\nMix genres for variety and interest.\nInclude a mix of fiction and non-fiction.\nConsider a humorous book for light-hearted moments.\nOpt for a classic novel you’ve always wanted to tackle.\n• \n• \n• \n• \n• \n• \n• \n• \n• \n• \n1",
      "Weekend Reading Schedule\nDay Time Activity\nFriday 7:00 PM - 9:00 PM Start with a light fiction novel.\nSaturday 10:00 AM - 12:00 PM Dive into a non-fiction book.\nSaturday 3:00 PM - 5:00 PM Read a humorous book.\nSunday 11:00 AM - 1:00 PM Continue with your classic\nnovel.\nSunday 3:00 PM - 5:00 PM Finish any book started.\n2"
